Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 8

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P006.2

Summary: MK7 read-only KDPadSetter chain discovery and 5s safety rehearsal

Description: |
    P006.2 prepares for local, supervised native input control.
    This preflight inspects the MK7 player-pad add-in chain
    and candidate KDPadSetter fields without writing memory.
    It retains P006.1 controller tracing, passive telemetry,
    CSV flight recorder, and the five-second dry-run/abort test.
    HID injection is disabled and no MK7 actuator is enabled.
    Native press and release must be designed after hardware
    calibration; this version cannot drive autonomously.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
